  autoDescription: 1
  description: 'Strip every buff from the enemy: raised ATK / DEF / SPD, timed buffs,
    crit rate above 5%, crit damage above 135%, Precision''s evasion pierce, evasion
    rating above 5, Regeneration stacks, Endurance, barriers, lifesteal, debuff immunity
    and Momentum. Then deal true damage equal to 10% (Max 12%) of your ATK for each
    buff removed (every Regeneration stack counts). Mana cost: 100.'
